Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 10:05:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] recovery: normal-exit bridge and loader guard for rothko

Adds an explicit normal-exit phase/bridge so a recovery-initiated reboot
to system reports every real outcome, plus a launcher/loader guard used by
the rothko recovery runtime.
